{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i>INCOMING TELEGRAM...</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1976860/extras/Morse1.gif?t=1744224601\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Repel the Kaiser's midnight onslaught through timing, tactics and telegraphy in MORSE.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong> </strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1976860/extras/vSD6q7.gif?t=1744224601\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">MORSE is a minimalist strategy game operated with just two buttons.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One button for\u00a0navigating\u00a0a grid of letters and numbers using Morse code.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The other unleashes a barrage of\u00a0artillery shells upon advancing German forces.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1976860/extras/Morse2.gif?t=1744224601\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1976860/extras/sZv10W.gif?t=1744224601\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Navigate ever changing grid of letters and numbers using the lost language of Morse Code. Learn a handful of simple letters then master the telegraphy tree to fully scale the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1976860/extras/Morse3.gif?t=1744224601\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1976860/extras/NQ7Rx7.gif?t=1744224601\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">German ships are shrouded by the cover of darkness, illuminate their positions using the flash of your artillery. Get a shot close enough and they'll be permanently revealed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1976860/extras/Morse4.gif?t=1744224601\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1976860/extras/Q4hdrt.gif?t=1744224601\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rain down salvos of shells on the Kaiser's fleet, your stock of artillery refills slowly so strike the centre of ships for maximum damage and to save ammunition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1976860/extras/Morse5.gif?t=1744224601\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1976860/extras/xJTt6Y.gif?t=1744224601\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After successfully repelling each assault, pick between a pair of upgrades to bolster your arsenal. Unlock new deadly types of artillery shell, improve your mines or enhance your reconnaissance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1976860/extras/Morse6.gif?t=1744224601\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1976860/extras/xxJFli.gif?t=1744224601\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deploy a blockade of sea mines to reveal and destroy any ships that slip past your artillery. Upgraded mines can withstand damage, have timed detonators and can relay warnings of German advancements.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1976860/extras/Morse7.gif?t=1744224601\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1976860/extras/OHRdtA.gif?t=1744224601\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With each wave, a new isogram is chosen, the vertical row extends, the number of units increase and new powerful German vessels emerge from the dark waters. Survive until dawn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i>Can you change the world with the push of a button?</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1976860/extras/fdu8JX.png?t=1744224601\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i><strong>&quot;MORSE is already shaping up to be a novel and compelling take on real-time strategy games.&quot; -\u00a0</strong></i><strong>Rock Paper Shotgun</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i><strong>&quot;A highly complete work with a unique concept.&quot; -\u00a0</strong></i><strong>IGN\u00a0Japan</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i><strong>&quot;MORSE is a game that highlights how simple a game can be while containing depth, complexity and joy.&quot; -\u00a0</strong></i><strong>Indiecade</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>ADDITIONAL\u00a0FEATURES:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1976860/extras/IMG_5583.jpg?t=1744224601\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">MORSE is played at exhibitions using an alternative controller made of a telegraph, 1930's naval telegraphist headphones and a spring loaded launch button.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Calibrate your telegraph in the settings menu depending on your fluency.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Split the two inputs\u00a0between two players for a cooperative experience.\u00a0\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">MORSE is Mouse, Steam gamepad and keyboard compatible (Steamdeck TBC)</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1976860?t=1744224601","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1976860/f11531a258fb1342f911530c9d2ffef92093e59a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744224601","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1976860/1213faadfb637c7162ac73ae3b9845600ef511b3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744224601","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1976860/1213faadfb637c7162ac73ae3b9845600ef511b3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744224601","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i>INCOMING TELEGRAM...</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1976860/extras/Morse1.gif?t=1744224601\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Repel the Kaiser's midnight onslaught through timing, tactics and telegraphy in MORSE.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong> </strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1976860/extras/vSD6q7.gif?t=1744224601\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">MORSE is a minimalist strategy game operated with just two buttons.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One button for\u00a0navigating\u00a0a grid of letters and numbers using Morse code.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The other unleashes a barrage of\u00a0artillery shells upon advancing German forces.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1976860/extras/Morse2.gif?t=1744224601\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1976860/extras/sZv10W.gif?t=1744224601\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Navigate ever changing grid of letters and numbers using the lost language of Morse Code. Learn a handful of simple letters then master the telegraphy tree to fully scale the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1976860/extras/Morse3.gif?t=1744224601\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1976860/extras/NQ7Rx7.gif?t=1744224601\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">German ships are shrouded by the cover of darkness, illuminate their positions using the flash of your artillery. Get a shot close enough and they'll be permanently revealed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1976860/extras/Morse4.gif?t=1744224601\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1976860/extras/Q4hdrt.gif?t=1744224601\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rain down salvos of shells on the Kaiser's fleet, your stock of artillery refills slowly so strike the centre of ships for maximum damage and to save ammunition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1976860/extras/Morse5.gif?t=1744224601\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1976860/extras/xJTt6Y.gif?t=1744224601\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After successfully repelling each assault, pick between a pair of upgrades to bolster your arsenal. Unlock new deadly types of artillery shell, improve your mines or enhance your reconnaissance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1976860/extras/Morse6.gif?t=1744224601\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1976860/extras/xxJFli.gif?t=1744224601\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deploy a blockade of sea mines to reveal and destroy any ships that slip past your artillery. Upgraded mines can withstand damage, have timed detonators and can relay warnings of German advancements.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1976860/extras/Morse7.gif?t=1744224601\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1976860/extras/OHRdtA.gif?t=1744224601\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With each wave, a new isogram is chosen, the vertical row extends, the number of units increase and new powerful German vessels emerge from the dark waters. Survive until dawn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i>Can you change the world with the push of a button?</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1976860/extras/fdu8JX.png?t=1744224601\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i><strong>&quot;MORSE is already shaping up to be a novel and compelling take on real-time strategy games.&quot; -\u00a0</strong></i><strong>Rock Paper Shotgun</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i><strong>&quot;A highly complete work with a unique concept.&quot; -\u00a0</strong></i><strong>IGN\u00a0Japan</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i><strong>&quot;MORSE is a game that highlights how simple a game can be while containing depth, complexity and joy.&quot; -\u00a0</strong></i><strong>Indiecade</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>ADDITIONAL\u00a0FEATURES:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1976860/extras/IMG_5583.jpg?t=1744224601\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">MORSE is played at exhibitions using an alternative controller made of a telegraph, 1930's naval telegraphist headphones and a spring loaded launch button.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Calibrate your telegraph in the settings menu depending on your fluency.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Split the two inputs\u00a0between two players for a cooperative experience.\u00a0\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">MORSE is Mouse, Steam gamepad and keyboard compatible (Steamdeck TBC)</p></li></ul>","developers":["ALJO Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1976860/c5d72256535b61bca77785e51b8d0dbca3f368ce/header.jpg?t=1744224601","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257122408,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257122408/movie480.mp4?t=1744059829","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257122408/movie_max.mp4?t=1744059829"},"name":"MORSE Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257122408/c46ef0b65c1fa336f33fba57a69214614fd92bef/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1744059829","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257122408/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1744059829","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257122408/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1744059829"}},{"highlight":true,"id":256884071,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256884071/movie480.mp4?t=1744059831","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256884071/movie_max.mp4?t=1744059831"},"name":"MORSE @ EGX","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256884071/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1744059831","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256884071/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1744059831","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256884071/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1744059831"}}],"name":"MORSE","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 or Later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Graphics card with DX10 (shader model 4.0) capabilities.<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["ALJO Games"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia\r\nLinguagem impr\u00f3pria","rating":"14","required_age":"14","use_age_gate":"true"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"To be announced"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1976860/001140135df126eeff1c2b63685012bcf01d4084/ss_001140135df126eeff1c2b63685012bcf01d4084.1920x1080.jpg?t=1744224601","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1976860/001140135df126eeff1c2b63685012bcf01d4084/ss_001140135df126eeff1c2b63685012bcf01d4084.600x338.jpg?t=1744224601"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1976860/7c62f13b7f57ed98f1ad796b847be87ea0b0954d/ss_7c62f13b7f57ed98f1ad796b847be87ea0b0954d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1744224601","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1976860/7c62f13b7f57ed98f1ad796b847be87ea0b0954d/ss_7c62f13b7f57ed98f1ad796b847be87ea0b0954d.600x338.jpg?t=1744224601"},{"id":2,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1976860/a3dbc304b3fe863a965f45a09b9cd65078650cc1/ss_a3dbc304b3fe863a965f45a09b9cd65078650cc1.1920x1080.jpg?t=1744224601","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1976860/a3dbc304b3fe863a965f45a09b9cd65078650cc1/ss_a3dbc304b3fe863a965f45a09b9cd65078650cc1.600x338.jpg?t=1744224601"},{"id":3,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1976860/699f5baf48eae6e7e4a8e65669712add5c2f020a/ss_699f5baf48eae6e7e4a8e65669712add5c2f020a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1744224601","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1976860/699f5baf48eae6e7e4a8e65669712add5c2f020a/ss_699f5baf48eae6e7e4a8e65669712add5c2f020a.600x338.jpg?t=1744224601"},{"id":4,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1976860/637085bcff41cf2f75d8c8ab7b6ddaf01e84d891/ss_637085bcff41cf2f75d8c8ab7b6ddaf01e84d891.1920x1080.jpg?t=1744224601","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1976860/637085bcff41cf2f75d8c8ab7b6ddaf01e84d891/ss_637085bcff41cf2f75d8c8ab7b6ddaf01e84d891.600x338.jpg?t=1744224601"}],"short_description":"Vanquish the Kaiser's Imperial Fleet using timing, tactics and telegraphy in MORSE, a single player typing game that teaches you the lost language of Morse code. Can you change the world with the push of a button?","steam_appid":1976860,"support_info":{"email":"","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/app/1976860/discussions/0/3278068162666968533/"},"supported_languages":"English","type":"game","website":"https://alexvscoding.itch.io/morse"}